      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Alright, it's entirely the OVRPlugin.dll file that @{5f8dfd442f97df18806208fa|full_name} said. I downloaded a old 2020 version of the file and put it in Oculus\\Software\\Software\\vrchat-vrchat\\VRChat_Data\\Plugins and it works fine. I would suggest https://www.opendll.com/index.php?file-download=ovrplugin.dll&arch=32bit&version=1.25.0.0 for the dll file, but please note that I have no idea if the site is safe. I checked the file and it was clean but use at your risk.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
